      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "I thought that might be the case ..." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "But...you can also help students " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q8" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Great...Is that also a one-on-one activity?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh, yes, definitely; but volunteers are also called on to " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q9" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "speaker": "Sharon",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "And, what exactly would we do there?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, ", "type": "text" },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q10" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " of course, but usually you take on " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q11" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "A teacher's assistant? Yes, that's it." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "speaker": "Sharon",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q12" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " and good preparation for our own careers." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Then, an enormous area of assistance is developing students' " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q13" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, I can imagine that's why some of them " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q14" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "There's also " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q15" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " They always need volunteers there." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "speaker": "Sharon",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "But we have no training in special needs." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "That's not necessary. These students just really appreciate having any extra attention-sometimes help with the simplest things " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q16" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Ah... well, that's something all able-bodied students should learn. " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q17" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " the strangest pen grips amongst my peers and I'm sure they must " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q18" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " or shoulder muscles " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q19" }
