      "id": 23,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "That'll be good." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q23" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " you'll be working alongside quality teachers " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q24" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " who are not only caring role-models but excellent motivators." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "speaker": "Sharon",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q25" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, the teachers you'll be assigned to are innovative and very responsive " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q26" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " individual students." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "If that's true, they " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q27" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " a variety of teaching styles." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Quite right. You know, part of my mission is to forge close partnerships between " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q28" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " like yourselves. As far as I can see everyone has something to gain from " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q29" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " -not just the students you're helping." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "There are a number of interesting developments going on at the moment and I've chosen you two because of " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q30" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " now, you, Sharon..." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "speaker": "Sharon",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "I majored in business studies before I came to teachers' " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q31" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, I've always been " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q32" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ", marine biology, in particular." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, I think " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q33" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " The school you're going to assist at is augmenting " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q34" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " offered within its subjects. Educational philosophy these days seems to recognise the importance of increasing practical components " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q35" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " Areas of development being pursued include " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q36" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ", agriculture, business education and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q37" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "; but the marine studies course is already " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q38" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh, now I see where we fit in." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "speaker": "Liaison",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "You'll find that the school has " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio35_q39" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " There are 3 computer laboratories and a special-needs network with 6 stations." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "speaker": "Lester",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Ah...they are well equipped." }
